# Realistic Uncertainty Scenario: Ad Hoc Rules in CulinaryControlEnv.place_delivery_order

## Uncertainty Manifestation: Delivery Address Zip Code Format Requirement

**Description**:
The API function requires delivery zip codes to be provided in a special format that combines the standard 5-digit zip code with a specific prefix indicating the delivery zone. This format must be "Z{zone}-{5-digit-zip}" where {zone} is a single letter (A-F) representing the delivery zone and {5-digit-zip} is the standard postal code. This requirement is not clearly explained in the documentation, and the error message when violated is not helpful in guiding developers to the correct format.

